---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

import { CALENDAR_URL, BOOKING_NOTE } from '../../config/site';

// The Strategic Reset Intensive (former Tier 0) is removed from this page until it is
// revamped for the mission-driven direction. Restore it from git history (commit b8d78dc).
---

<Layout
  title="Fractional Lane - Embedded Strategic Partnership"
  description="Embedded strategic partnership for leadership teams facing burnout, execution drag, and leadership architecture risk."
  section="st"
  accentColor="teal"
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[78vh] flex items-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-st-gradient"></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0"
      style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 82% 32%, rgba(13,158,138,0.12) 0%, transparent 60%);"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]"
      style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 25% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,0.6) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px;"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="absolute right-[-6rem] top-20 h-64 w-64 rotate-12 border border-teal-DEFAULT/20"
      style="clip-path: polygon(25% 6.7%, 75% 6.7%, 100% 50%, 75% 93.3%, 25% 93.3%, 0% 50%);"
    ></div>
    <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px] bg-teal-DEFAULT"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl text-center lg:text-left">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="st-tag inline-flex">Strategic Transformations Readiness Group</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted border border-border rounded-full px-3 py-1">
            URI-rooted leadership architecture
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-6xl text-light font-bold leading-tight mb-6 animate-on-scroll">
          Embedded Strategic Partnership for Leadership Architecture
        </h1>
        <p
          class="text-light text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 mb-4 animate-on-scroll"
          style="animation-delay:0.08s"
        >
          I help leadership teams identify and correct the structural misalignment driving burnout and execution risk.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 mb-8 animate-on-scroll"
          style="animation-delay:0.12s"
        >
          This is an embedded strategic partnership anchored in the Unmasking Restore Intelligence (URI) framework. We work inside real decision environments to reduce leadership architecture risk, restore authority-accountability alignment, and protect human sustainability.
        </p>
        <div class="mb-8 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.16s">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted mb-2">
            A Strategic Transformations Readiness Group embedded partnership model
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-light">
            Access is curated. Fractional, Recalibration, and Stabilization engagements are scoped by fit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
          <a href="#lane-boundaries" class="btn-teal">See the three lanes</a>
          <a href={CALENDAR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline-teal">Book a Call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="booking-note">{BOOKING_NOTE}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LANE BOUNDARIES -->
  <section id="lane-boundaries" class="section-pad bg-[#0c1525]">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="st-tag mb-4 inline-flex">Three Lanes</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-light mb-4">
          Clear boundaries. Clear outcomes.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          These lanes are designed to match organizational need: embedded decision partnership, intensive structural redesign, and ongoing post-recalibration guardrails.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <div class="card teal-hover animate-on-scroll flex flex-col">
          <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-3">Lane 1</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-light text-2xl mb-3">Fractional Advisory</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1">
            Embedded, inside-the-room leadership support for ongoing decision-making, authority alignment, and execution continuity.
          </p>
          <p class="text-light text-sm"><span class="text-teal-DEFAULT font-semibold">Begins with a discovery call</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card teal-hover animate-on-scroll flex flex-col" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
          <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-3">Lane 2</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-light text-2xl mb-3">UNMASK Recalibration</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1">
            A 90-day high-intensity project that redesigns authority, accountability, and structural flow across leadership systems.
          </p>
          <p class="text-light text-sm"><span class="text-teal-DEFAULT font-semibold">Scoped after a discovery call</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card teal-hover animate-on-scroll flex flex-col" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
          <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-3">Lane 3</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-light text-2xl mb-3">UNMASK Stabilization</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1">
            Post-recalibration maintenance lane that keeps new leadership architecture stable through guardrails and strategic oversight.
          </p>
          <p class="text-light text-sm"><span class="text-teal-DEFAULT font-semibold">Begins with a discovery call</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card border-teal-DEFAULT/30 bg-teal-DEFAULT/5 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center animate-on-scroll">
        <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-2">Industry Focus</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Current sector emphasis: <span class="text-light font-semibold">Healthcare, Tech, Finance, and Nonprofits</span>. In many of these environments, burnout pressure is currently estimated in the <span class="text-light font-semibold">70-85%</span> range, making leadership architecture risk a live operational issue rather than a culture side topic.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIER OVERVIEW -->
  <section id="tier-overview" class="section-pad bg-[#0c1525]">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="st-tag mb-4 inline-flex">Two engagement tiers</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-light mb-4">
          One lane. Two levels of depth.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Each tier is designed with clear boundaries, curated access, and intentional capacity limits. Not every engagement will be the right fit - and that is by design.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="card teal-hover animate-on-scroll flex flex-col" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
          <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-3">Tier 1 · By Invitation</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-light text-2xl mb-3">Premium Intensive</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1">
            A private, deep-dive intensive for women who need personalized strategic architecture, decision clarity, and execution support.
          </p>
          <div class="border-t border-border pt-4 mb-5 space-y-1">
            <p class="text-light text-sm"><span class="text-teal-DEFAULT font-semibold">Request fit review</span> · Base intensive</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-sm">Follow-up and team workshop options scoped after a discovery call</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-2">Two slots per month maximum</p>
          </div>
          <a href="#tier-1" class="btn-outline-teal w-full text-center text-sm">See Tier 1 details</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card teal-hover animate-on-scroll flex flex-col" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
          <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-3">Tier 3 · By Invitation</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-light text-2xl mb-3">Fractional Strategic Advisory</p>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4 flex-1">
            Ongoing embedded advisory for organizations navigating structural change, leadership transitions, and AI-era complexity - from the inside.
          </p>
          <div class="border-t border-border pt-4 mb-5 space-y-1">
            <p class="text-light text-sm"><span class="text-teal-DEFAULT font-semibold">Begins with a discovery call</span> · Monthly retainer</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-sm">Segmented by org stage and sector</p>
            <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-2">One client at a time</p>
          </div>
          <a href="#tier-3" class="btn-outline-teal w-full text-center text-sm">See Tier 3 details</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIER 1 -->
  <section id="tier-1" class="section-pad bg-[#0c1525] relative overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0"
      style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 80% 50%, rgba(13,158,138,0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);"
    ></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="mb-10 p-4 rounded-md border border-teal-DEFAULT/20 bg-teal-DEFAULT/5 max-w-3xl animate-on-scroll">
        <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-1">Protected Access</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm">
          Tier 1 is available by invitation only. If you have been directed here by Nikki or a trusted referral, booking a discovery call is your right next step. This offering is not listed as an open-access service.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-8 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="st-tag inline-flex">Tier 1 · By Invitation</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-teal-DEFAULT border border-teal-DEFAULT/30 rounded-full px-3 py-1">
          Premium Intensive
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start mb-16">
        <div class="animate-on-scroll">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-light mb-6">
            A private, personalized deep-dive.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The Premium Intensive is a high-proximity, single-session engagement designed for women navigating complex leadership transitions, organizational strain, or strategic pivots that require more precision than a group format can provide.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            This is personalized strategic architecture - not a coaching call, not a one-size-fits-all framework. You will leave with a clear diagnostic, a decision framework, and a next-step plan built for your specific context.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Two slots available per month. This is not a marketing tactic. It is a capacity boundary that protects the quality of every engagement.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.12s">
          {[
            { title: 'Premium Intensive', entry: 'Request fit review', desc: 'The core engagement. A private, intensive session with customized pre-work, deep diagnostic, and a personalized execution architecture.' },
            { title: 'Follow-Up Session', entry: 'Scoped in review', desc: 'A private follow-up session for participants who need strategic check-in, course correction, or continued accountability after the intensive.' },
            { title: 'Team Workshop', entry: 'Scoped in review', desc: 'An organizational extension workshop to bring strategic clarity and shared language to your leadership team or direct reports.' },
          ].map((item) => (
            <div class="p-5 rounded-md border border-border hover:border-teal-DEFAULT/40 transition-colors bg-surface/50">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-2">
                <p class="font-heading text-light font-semibold text-lg">{item.title}</p>
                <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0">{item.entry}</p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">{item.desc}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
          <div class="p-4 rounded-md bg-teal-DEFAULT/5 border border-teal-DEFAULT/20">
            <p class="text-muted text-xs">Two Tier 1 engagements per month maximum. Add-ons available exclusively to current Tier 1 participants. Payment and intake details shared after fit is confirmed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="animate-on-scroll">
        <a href={CALENDAR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline-teal">Book a Call</a>
        <p class="booking-note">{BOOKING_NOTE}</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-3">By invitation only. Inquiries reviewed before any engagement details are shared.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIER 3 -->
  <section id="tier-3" class="section-pad relative overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0"
      style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 50% 50%, rgba(13,158,138,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);"
    ></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="mb-10 p-4 rounded-md border border-teal-DEFAULT/20 bg-teal-DEFAULT/5 max-w-3xl animate-on-scroll">
        <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] mb-1">Protected Access</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm">
          Tier 3 is available by referral and invitation only. This is a one-client-at-a-time advisory relationship and is not listed as an open-access service. If you have been directed here by Nikki or a trusted source, booking a discovery call is your right next step.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-8 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="st-tag inline-flex">Tier 3 · By Invitation</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-teal-DEFAULT border border-teal-DEFAULT/30 rounded-full px-3 py-1">
          Fractional Strategic Advisory
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start mb-16">
        <div class="animate-on-scroll">
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-light mb-6">
            Embedded advisory for organizations navigating structural change from the inside.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The Fractional Strategic Advisory is an ongoing embedded relationship - not a retainer for periodic advice, but a sustained presence inside your organizational decision-making structure. Nikki works alongside leadership to name what is structural, recover what has been hidden, and build systems that don't depend on one person's overfunctioning to hold together.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
            This engagement is rooted in the URI framework - a liberation-centered architecture for organizational change that centers sustainability, equity, and structural honesty rather than performance and speed.
          </p>
          <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
            One client at a time. This is not a scalability play. It is a commitment to depth.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.12s">
          <span class="st-tag mb-5 inline-flex">Monthly Retainer Segments</span>
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-6">
            {[
              {
                segment: 'Early Stage / Nonprofit',
                entry: 'Request Briefing',
                desc: 'For mission-driven organizations, early-stage companies, and nonprofits navigating structural transition with limited executive bandwidth.',
              },
              {
                segment: 'Growth / Mid-Size',
                entry: 'Request Briefing',
                desc: 'For growing organizations that have outpaced their structural foundation and need embedded advisory to stabilize, reorient, and build with more integrity.',
              },
              {
                segment: 'Corporate / Enterprise',
                entry: 'Request Briefing',
                desc: 'For larger organizations navigating complex structural change, leadership misalignment, or AI-era disruption at scale.',
              },
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="p-5 rounded-md border border-border hover:border-teal-DEFAULT/40 transition-colors bg-surface/50">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-2">
                  <p class="font-heading text-light font-semibold">{item.segment}</p>
                  <p class="text-teal-DEFAULT font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">
                    {item.entry}
                  </p>
                </div>
                <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">{item.desc}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-md bg-teal-DEFAULT/5 border border-teal-DEFAULT/20">
            <p class="text-muted text-xs">One Tier 3 client at a time. Scope is shaped by organizational stage and sector, not deliverable volume. Engagement terms shared during fit conversation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="animate-on-scroll">
        <a href={CALENDAR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-teal">Book a Call</a>
        <p class="booking-note">{BOOKING_NOTE}</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-xs mt-3">By referral and invitation only. Inquiries screened before engagement details are shared.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DISCOVERY CALL
       The inquiry form (and its scoring script) was replaced with a discovery call link.
       Restore it from git history (commit 9c16c15) if a form is needed again. -->
  <section id="discovery-call" class="section-pad bg-[#0c1525]">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="text-center animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="st-tag mb-4 inline-flex">Next Step</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-light mb-4">
          Start with a discovery call.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Every engagement begins with a discovery call. We will talk through your organization, what your leaders are carrying, and which tier fits.
        </p>
        <a href={CALENDAR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-teal">Book a Call</a>
        <p class="booking-note">{BOOKING_NOTE}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT NIKKI -->
  <section class="section-pad relative overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0"
      style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 50% 50%, rgba(13,158,138,0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);"
    ></div>
    <div class="container-mid relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 animate-on-scroll">
        <span class="st-tag mb-4 inline-flex">About the Work</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-light mb-4">
          Learn more about Nikki Cates
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card border-teal-DEFAULT/20 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center animate-on-scroll">
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Nikki Cates is a liberation-centered strategist, author, and organizational architect whose work sits at the intersection of structural burnout, leadership sustainability, and the AI era. She developed the Unmasking Restore Intelligence (URI) framework to help women and organizations name what is structural, recover what has been hidden, and build leadership systems that don't depend on someone's overfunctioning to hold together.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Her work through Strategic Transformations Readiness Group addresses the root causes of burnout, authority mismatch, and AI-era strain - not just the symptoms. If you are encountering this page for the first time, the books and ST resources are a strong and accessible starting point.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/books/" class="btn-teal">Explore the Books</a>
          <a href="/" class="btn-outline-teal">Main Site</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NEWSLETTER + FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0c1525]">
    <div class="container-mid relative z-10 text-center animate-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl text-light mb-4">
        Not ready for a call yet?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Stay connected through the Unbothered Collective newsletter - strategic clarity, structural honesty, and liberation-centered leadership for women navigating the AI era. No performance. No hustle culture. Just truth and direction.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/n1afrRyJLvJOME1jHLGo"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-teal"
        >Join the Newsletter</a>
        <a href="/books/" class="btn-outline-teal">Explore the Books</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
